#: app/src/main.rs:100
msgid ""
"Usage: penguin-mail [--background] [--demo] [--compose [mailto:ADDRESS]] "
"[FILE.ics]\n"
"\n"
"  --version      print the version and quit\n"
"  --background   start in the tray without opening a window\n"
"  --demo         open sample mail in a throwaway store; nothing syncs\n"
"  --compose      open a new message, addressed to ADDRESS when given\n"
"  mailto:...     the same as --compose mailto:...\n"
"  FILE.ics       open a calendar file, to add its events to a calendar"
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan: penguin-mail [--background] [--demo] [--compose "
"[mailto:ADDRESS]] [FILE.ics]\n"
"\n"
"  --version      tampilkan versi dan keluar\n"
"  --background   mulai di baki tanpa membuka jendela\n"
"  --demo         buka contoh email di penyimpanan sementara; tanpa "
"sinkronisasi\n"
"  --compose      buka pesan baru, dengan tujuan ADDRESS jika diberikan\n"
"  mailto:...     sama dengan --compose mailto:...\n"
"  FILE.ics       buka berkas kalender untuk menambahkan acaranya ke kalender"

