#: app/src/ui/contacts_prefs.rs:264
msgid ""
"Penguin Mail can read an account's contacts: names, email addresses, photos, "
"organizations, and phone numbers. It uses them to suggest recipients, to "
"show faces beside mail, and to fill the card behind a sender's name. What it "
"reads stays on this computer, and turning an account off deletes its "
"contacts."
msgstr ""
"Penguin Mail dapat membaca kontak akun: nama, alamat email, foto, "
"organisasi, dan nomor telepon. Data ini digunakan untuk menyarankan "
"penerima, menampilkan wajah di samping email, dan mengisi kartu di balik "
"nama pengirim. Data yang dibaca tetap di komputer ini, dan menonaktifkan "
"akun akan menghapus kontaknya."

